# Task triage

Before planning or editing, print the verdict from
`docs/governance/AGENT_TASK_TRIAGE_POLICY.md`: per-axis scores (0–2), total,
harness **Cursor**, recommended model role (cheapest / mid / frontier),
effort, subagents, budget, and stop condition.

Do not copy the routing table into this file or into other Cursor rules.

Do not spawn subagents unless the user asked. Cursor does not let the agent
switch the session model; recommend the role and continue.

